    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="45.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 45.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf laford his ðeowan freolsdæge nyde to weorce, ðolie ðæs ðeowan ⁊ beo he syððan folcfrig; ⁊ gylde lahslit se laford mid Denum, wite mid Englum, bi ðam þe seo dæd sy; oððe geladie hine.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a lord compels his slave to work during a church festival, he shall lose the slave, who shall henceforth obtain the rights of a freeman, and the lord shall pay lahslit in a Danish district and a fine in an English one, according to the nature of the offence, or else he shall clear himself.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hlaford his þeowan freolsdæge nyde to weorce, þolige þæs þeowan; ⁊ beo he syððan folcfrig; ⁊ gylde lahslit se hlaford mid Denum, wite mid Englum, be ðam þe seo dæd sig; oððe hine geladige.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
